        "Description": "额外条件：\r吃饭很重要：在后厨2个厨师没有被制服/消灭且不被2人发现的情况下制作给普里查德的饭菜并送出\r后厨惨案：将陈婷在经过后厨时将其击杀\r晚宴结束：在击杀李洪之后破坏3盏灯笼\rAdditional conditions:\r*Prepare the food for Mr.Pritchard and sent it to him when 2 chefs in kitchen are not pacified/eliminated,and don&apos;t be spotted by them.\r*Eliminate Chen Ting when she passing the kitchen.\r*When Lee Hong was eliminated,destroy 3 lanterns",
